WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:11.740
Humankind hates and fears changes, we fear tomorrow.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:17.100
And it is entirely likely and definite that the Arctic is going to change.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:24.940
There is an entire choir of mourners which is easy to join, about how terrible these changes are,

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.220
and indeed it is terrible, but we can at least be happy

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.940
that we ourselves are the ones who created this catastrophe,

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:37.680
as well as we can look forward to the change, since change always brings about something new.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.780
It is not very politically correct to say so but ... Variety is the spice of life.

